  "question": {
    "text": "The equation of the circle described on the chord <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;of the circle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;as&nbsp;the diameter is&nbsp;"
